    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a stinky situation in\u00a0Catch the Skunk! The skunks are causing a ruckus, and it\u2019s up to you to save the other creatures from their smell. Use your wits to drag the puzzle pieces onto the board, covering all the skunks with crates while ensuring no pieces overlap. But watch out\u2014don\u2019t accidentally cover any of the other critters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Skunk is a puzzle game from SmartGames, comes with <strong>60 challenges</strong> across 5 smelly worlds and will definitely test your capture skills!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you become the World\u2019s Smartest Gamer?</strong>\u00a0</p>",
